OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy with best of
OL,6,Flimited brighter spells early morning.
OL,7,FSome patchy rain, mostly west of the
OL,8,FA9. South to southeast winds brisk
OL,9,Faround the coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FPatchy rain turning heavy at
OL,12,Ftimes overnight, before clearing from
OL,13,Fthe west towards dawn, but perhaps
OL,14,Flingering around the coast come dawn.
OL,15,FBrisk southerly coastal winds easing
OL,16,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
